OL,3,GNEWSAModest boost for Belfast hotels
OL,4,Aduring All Ireland Fleadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe All Ireland Fleadh gave the Belfast
OL,7,Fhotel market a modest boost during
OL,8,FAugust, initial survey data suggests.
OL,10,FThe official figures show in the period
OL,11,FJanuary to August average room
OL,12,Foccupancy reached 77%, up 6 percentage
OL,13,Fpoints from 71% during the same period
OL,14,Fin 2025.
OL,16,FAcross Northern Ireland as a whole,
OL,17,Fofficial estimates show almost 470,000
OL,18,Fbeds were sold in August 2026, up 5%
OL,19,Ffrom the 447,000 in August 2025.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
