OL,3,GNEWSAModest boost for Belfast hotels
OL,4,Aduring All Ireland Fleadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Fleadh Cheoil na hEireann ran from
OL,7,F2 to 9 August - it was the first time
OL,8,Fthe event had been held in Belfast.
